      "writtenOn": "2024-07-12T13:05:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this need some sort of check that `isRkpOnly().has_value()`, to prevent an exception on `std::nullopt`?\n\nAnd what do we want to happen next if it is `nullopt`?",
      "revId": "5d4876fac6b68e8f29ffa08ea418e63a0112c180",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "10b42323_097cefe2",
